{"id":67327,"date":"2026-09-10T09:48:23","date_gmt":"2026-09-10T08:48:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67327"},"modified":"2026-09-13T14:25:44","modified_gmt":"2026-09-13T13:25:44","slug":"corrida-nacional-do-professor-e-da-educacao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-nacional-do-professor-e-da-educacao\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Nacional do Professor e da Educa\u00e7\u00e3o 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Nacional do Professor e da Educa\u00e7\u00e3o 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>8.\u00aa Corrida Nacional do Professor e da Educa\u00e7\u00e3o 2026<\/strong> afirma-se como uma das mais emblem\u00e1ticas celebra\u00e7\u00f5es desportivas da comunidade educativa em Portugal, unindo atletas, docentes, estudantes e fam\u00edlias no cora\u00e7\u00e3o monumental de Lisboa. Promovida pela <strong>Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Nacional dos Professores (FENPROF)<\/strong>, em estreita parceria com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lisboa<\/strong> e com o prestigiado enquadramento t\u00e9cnico da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa (AAL)<\/strong>, a prova decorre na manh\u00e3 de s\u00e1bado, <strong>24 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, tendo como cen\u00e1rio de partida a <strong>Avenida Bras\u00edlia<\/strong>, frente \u00e0 imponente <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio<\/strong> e junto ao Centro Cultural de Bel\u00e9m.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com um tra\u00e7ado totalmente plano em piso de asfalto, desenhado \u00e0 beira-rio ao longo da frente ribeirinha lisboeta entre Alg\u00e9s e Alc\u00e2ntara, o certame oferece condi\u00e7\u00f5es excecionais para a obten\u00e7\u00e3o de recordes pessoais na <strong>Corrida Principal de 10 km<\/strong> (com partida \u00e0s 11:00 e aberta a corredores e atletas em cadeira de rodas) ou para desfrutar do conv\u00edvio na <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (\u00e0s 11:05). A manh\u00e3 abre \u00e0s 10:00 com o <strong>Trof\u00e9u Novas Gera\u00e7\u00f5es FENPROF\/AAL<\/strong>, proporcionando dist\u00e2ncias dos 500m aos 2.000m para jovens dos 7 aos 15 anos. Todos os participantes t\u00eam direito a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal com chip eletr\u00f3nico, medalha de finalista, abastecimentos e pr\u00e9mios para os melhores de cada escal\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida Bras\u00edlia (em frente \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, junto ao CCB), Bel\u00e9m, Lisboa, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km, 5 km (Caminhada) e Trof\u00e9u Novas Gera\u00e7\u00f5es (500m a 2000m)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Nacional dos Professores (FENPROF), C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lisboa e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12:30<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida 10 km<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 11\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 18\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:05<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 5.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 11\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 18\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trof\u00e9u Novas Gera\u00e7\u00f5es FENPROF\/AAL<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 18\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rio de partida da Corrida Nacional do Professor e da Educa\u00e7\u00e3o 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro de 2026, na zona de Bel\u00e9m em Lisboa. A partida tem lugar na Avenida Bras\u00edlia, em frente \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio (junto ao CCB). O Trof\u00e9u Novas Gera\u00e7\u00f5es arranca \u00e0s 10:00, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 11:00 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 11:05.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui a Corrida Principal de 10 km de cariz competitivo (aberta a todos os escal\u00f5es a partir de juniores e atletas em cadeira de rodas), a Caminhada de 5 km participativa e sem fins competitivos aberta a todas as idades, e o Trof\u00e9u Novas Gera\u00e7\u00f5es para jovens dos 7 aos 15 anos com dist\u00e2ncias de 500m a 2.000m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 o percurso da prova de 10 km em Bel\u00e9m?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso \u00e9 totalmente plano e em piso de asfalto junto ao Rio Tejo: parte da Avenida Bras\u00edlia em Bel\u00e9m, segue at\u00e9 ao viaduto de Alg\u00e9s com retorno, ruma no sentido nascente at\u00e9 ao viaduto de Alc\u00e2ntara com novo retorno, finalizando na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais e do kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento dos dorsais e das t-shirts t\u00e9cnicas oficiais realiza-se nos dias 22 e 23 de outubro na sede da FENPROF em Lisboa (das 10:00 \u00e0s 17:00) ou no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova, 24 de outubro, no secretariado junto \u00e0 partida em Bel\u00e9m (das 08:00 \u00e0s 10:00).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e quais s\u00e3o os valores dos bilhetes?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online na plataforma oficial at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 18 de outubro de 2026. A Corrida de 10 km tem o valor de 7 \u20ac (at\u00e9 11\/10) e 10 \u20ac (at\u00e9 18\/10). A Caminhada de 5 km custa 5 \u20ac (at\u00e9 11\/10) e 7 \u20ac (at\u00e9 18\/10). O Trof\u00e9u Novas Gera\u00e7\u00f5es \u00e9 gratuito. S\u00f3cios da FENPROF t\u00eam 50% de desconto mediante c\u00f3digo do sindicato.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida Nacional do Professor e da Educa\u00e7\u00e3o 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-24\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida Bras\u00edlia (em frente \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, junto ao CCB), Bel\u00e9m, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Nacional dos Professores (FENPROF), C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lisboa e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rio de partida da Corrida Nacional do Professor e da Educa\u00e7\u00e3o 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro de 2026, na zona de Bel\u00e9m em Lisboa. A partida tem lugar na Avenida Bras\u00edlia, em frente \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio (junto ao CCB). O Trof\u00e9u Novas Gera\u00e7\u00f5es arranca \u00e0s 10:00, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 11:00 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 11:05.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e quem pode participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui a Corrida Principal de 10 km de cariz competitivo (aberta a todos os escal\u00f5es a partir de juniores e atletas em cadeira de rodas), a Caminhada de 5 km participativa e sem fins competitivos aberta a todas as idades, e o Trof\u00e9u Novas Gera\u00e7\u00f5es para jovens dos 7 aos 15 anos com dist\u00e2ncias de 500m a 2.000m.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como \u00e9 o percurso da prova de 10 km em Bel\u00e9m?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso \u00e9 totalmente plano e em piso de asfalto junto ao Rio Tejo: parte da Avenida Bras\u00edlia em Bel\u00e9m, segue at\u00e9 ao viaduto de Alg\u00e9s com retorno, ruma no sentido nascente at\u00e9 ao viaduto de Alc\u00e2ntara com novo retorno, finalizando na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais e do kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento dos dorsais e das t-shirts t\u00e9cnicas oficiais realiza-se nos dias 22 e 23 de outubro na sede da FENPROF em Lisboa (das 10:00 \u00e0s 17:00) ou no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova, 24 de outubro, no secretariado junto \u00e0 partida em Bel\u00e9m (das 08:00 \u00e0s 10:00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e quais s\u00e3o os valores dos bilhetes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online na plataforma oficial at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 18 de outubro de 2026. A Corrida de 10 km tem o valor de 7 \u20ac (at\u00e9 11\/10) e 10 \u20ac (at\u00e9 18\/10). A Caminhada de 5 km custa 5 \u20ac (at\u00e9 11\/10) e 7 \u20ac (at\u00e9 18\/10). O Trof\u00e9u Novas Gera\u00e7\u00f5es \u00e9 gratuito. S\u00f3cios da FENPROF t\u00eam 50% de desconto mediante c\u00f3digo do sindicato.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67333,"menu_order":0,